<SPT><TTL>DELIVERY AND STORAGE</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Ship equipment completely factory assembled, except when the physical size, arrangement, or configuration of the equipment, or shipping limitations, 
makes the shipment of completely assembled equipment impracticable, in which case assemble the equipment and ship as stated in the Contractor's 
proposal.  Provide storage and protection of delivered equipment in accordance with manufacturer's recommendations.</TXT><BRK/>
